  <main id="main">
    <section class="hero" id="top">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> INDEPENDENT 3D ENGINE · DEVELOPMENT ARCHIVE</p>
        <h1>不是把輪子重做一次，<br><em>而是理解它為何轉動。</em></h1>
        <p class="lead">Aevrynd 是以 C++20、Win32 與 DirectX 12 自研的 Windows 原生遊戲引擎。從 2.5D 塔防《裂隙守望者》，一路走到 PBR 開放世界、環境碰撞、體積大氣、角色系統與本地 AI；每一步都有可重現的測試與版本化展示。</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button primary" href="#journey">查看演進歷程 <span>↓</span></a>
          <a class="button ghost" href="https://github.com/peca12968/AevryndWeb" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">展示專案 ↗</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="engine-window" aria-label="抽象化的引擎運作視窗">
        <div class="window-bar"><span></span><span></span><span></span><b>AEVRYND / DIRECTX 12</b><i>ULTRA</i></div>
        <div class="viewport">
          <div class="world-grid"></div>
          <div class="core-orbit orbit-one"></div>
          <div class="core-orbit orbit-two"></div>
          <div class="core">A</div>
          <div class="metric metric-a"><small>FIXED LOOP</small><strong>60 Hz</strong></div>
          <div class="metric metric-b"><small>STRESS SCENE</small><strong>6,561 meshes</strong></div>
          <div class="viewport-caption">C++20 / WIN32 / DX12 / LOCAL AI</div>
        </div>
        <div class="console-line"><span>›</span> engine.tick() <i>CSM · PBR · HDR · VOLUMETRICS</i><b>v2.86.0</b></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="character-studio" id="character" aria-labelledby="character-title">
      <article class="character-editor" data-character-editor>
        <header>
          <p class="section-index">CHARACTER STUDIO / 3D WIP</p>
          <h2 id="character-title">同一角色 · 360° 細節調整</h2>
        </header>
        <div class="character-editor-layout">
          <div class="character-editor-viewport" data-editor-viewport tabindex="0" aria-label="角色三維預覽，拖曳環繞，方向鍵旋轉，滾輪縮放">
            <p data-editor-status role="status">正在準備三維角色…</p>
          </div>
          <aside class="character-editor-panel" aria-label="角色檢視控制">
            <fieldset>
              <legend>鏡頭</legend>
              <button type="button" data-editor-view="face" aria-pressed="true" disabled>臉部特寫</button>
              <button type="button" data-editor-view="body" aria-pressed="false" disabled>全身視角</button>
            </fieldset>
            <label>環繞角度 <output data-orbit-output>0°</output><input type="range" min="-180" max="180" step="1" value="0" data-editor-orbit disabled></label>
            <fieldset>
              <legend>服裝</legend>
              <button type="button" data-editor-clothing="on" aria-pressed="true" disabled>穿著上衣與長褲</button>
              <button type="button" data-editor-clothing="off" aria-pressed="false" disabled>裸體（18+）</button>
            </fieldset>
            <div data-editor-shapes aria-label="臉部與體態連續塑形滑桿"></div>
            <button type="button" data-editor-reset disabled>恢復原始設定</button>
            <p>拖曳可從任何方向查看同一個角色。上衣與長褲都是角色資產中的真正三維網格，不使用圖片覆蓋。</p>
            <p>目前是尚未上架的開發中預覽；使用指定第三版角色與 fitted pants 來源。滑桿只列出模型實際提供的塑形，材質、體態與動畫仍待完整驗收。</p>
            <noscript><p>請啟用 JavaScript 以操作 3D 模型。</p></noscript>
          </aside>
        </div>
        <div class="nudity-confirm" data-nudity-confirm role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="nudity-confirm-title" aria-describedby="nudity-confirm-copy" hidden>
          <div class="nudity-confirm-panel">
            <p class="section-index">CONTENT CONFIRMATION / 18+</p>
            <h3 id="nudity-confirm-title">確定切換為裸體模型嗎？</h3>
            <p id="nudity-confirm-copy">這會隱藏角色的上衣與長褲網格，顯示開發中的人體藝術模型。</p>
            <div class="nudity-confirm-actions">
              <button type="button" data-nudity-approve>確認切換</button>
              <button type="button" data-nudity-cancel>取消</button>
